{"series":{"id":"lord-of-the-universe-2","slug":"lord-of-the-universe-2","title":"Lord of the Universe","image":"https://www.mundodonghua.com/thumbs/L/Lord_of_the_Universe_2/139e541k7o5_j9lx65tf.jpg","synopsis":"Ye Chen, un dios antiguo, que ha caído desde el mundo de los dioses a un mundo celeste y pacifico. En este mundo hay cientos de países, rodeados por miles de estados, que son fuertes y arrogantes. Ye Chen ha estado en este mundo durante cientos de años y ha establecido una gran fuerza, además su existencia siempre ha sido en una leyenda. Pero el poder del mundo de los dioses lentamente se extiende a este mundo, dando comienzo a una de las batallas más crueles y feroces.","status":"En emisión","year":2017,"genres":["Acción","Artes Marciales","Aventura","Cultivación","Harem","Lucha","Romance"],"type":"donghua","src":"mundodonghua","sourceUrls":["https://www.mundodonghua.xyz/donghua/lord-of-the-universe-2","https://www.mundodonghua.xyz/donghua/lord-of-the-universe","https://www.mundodonghua.xyz/donghua/lord-of-the-universe-3"],"updatedAt":"2026-09-20T05:26:03.075Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"lord-of-the-universe-2-t2","slug":"lord-of-the-universe-2-t2","seriesId":"lord-of-the-universe-2","number":2,"image":"https://www.mundodonghua.com/thumbs/L/Lord_of_the_Universe_2/139e541k7o5_j9lx65tf.jpg","updatedAt":"2026-09-20T05:26:03.075Z"},{"id":"lord-of-the-universe-2-t1","slug":"lord-of-the-universe-2-t1","seriesId":"lord-of-the-universe-2","number":1,"image":"https://www.mundodonghua.com/thumbs/L/Lord_of_the_Universe_2/139e541k7o5_j9lx65tf.jpg","updatedAt":"2026-09-20T05:26:03.075Z"},{"id":"lord-of-the-universe-2-t3","slug":"lord-of-the-universe-2-t3","seriesId":"lord-of-the-universe-2","number":3,"image":"https://www.mundodonghua.com/thumbs/L/Lord_of_the_Universe_2/139e541k7o5_j9lx65tf.jpg","updatedAt":"2026-09-20T05:26:03.075Z"}],"episodes":[]}